    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dd4 (\u0dc0\u0dc0\u0daf\u0dba) \u0dbb\u0dcf\u0db8\u0db1\u0dcf\u0daf\u0db1\u0dca \u0d85\u0dbb\u0dca\u0da0\u0dca\u0da0\u0db1\u0db1\u0dcf \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc7\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc7\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 (\u0bae\u0bc6\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0baf\u0bb0\u0bcd) \u0b87\u0bb0\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bc7\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba4\u0ba9\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bc1\u0ba9\u0bc6\u0bbe) (The Hon. (Dr.) Ramanathan Archchuna) Good morning to you! Sir, I am really thankful to you for giving me this opportunity to raise this matter of Privilege in Parliament.\n\n\"Subject: Request to Restore My Parliamentary Privileges and Address the Misleading Allegations Raised Against Me.\n\nHon. Speaker,\n\nI, Dr. Ramanathan Archchuna, Member of Parliament and the Leader of Independent Group 17, respectfully write to bring to your kind attention a matter of serious concern pertaining to the restriction placed on broadcasting my Parliamentary speeches through official media and live telecasts of Parliament.\n\nIt is with deep regret and dismay that I have come to understand that this restriction was imposed based on the statements made by Hon. Bimal Rathnayake, the Leader of the House, during the second week....\"\n\nI guess, it was on the 17th.\n\n\"....of March 2025, in which he alleged that I had made derogatory remarks in Parliament referring to a respected lady lawyer, Ms. Swasthika Arulingam, in an undignified and inappropriate manner,....\"\n\n825 826\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0db8\u0dda\u0dc1 \u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\n\nHe had mentioned that I have assaulted her in a sexual manner. The letter goes on to state,\n\n\".....and additionally claimed that I had made remarks offensive to the Muslim community in Sri Lanka.\n\nI categorically deny these allegations.\"\n\nAgain, I say that I categorically denying these allegations.\n\n\"I am firmly committed to upholding the dignity of this House and the rights of all communities in Sri Lanka, including the Tamil and Muslim minority populations, whom I proudly represent.\"\n\nI was given a mandate by the people of Jaffna, who are Tamils and Muslims. So, kindly consider that."
  },
